;; What the model reads of each tool brainyard/eventlog.clj defines: its description,
;; by tool id (brainyard.tool-words, byj-2e8.5). Read by the model, so a
;; resource (RFC-001).
{"log$events"
  "What this project's agent DID in earlier runs, newest first. Reach for it when something used to work, when a tool or hook is not behaving as its definition says, or when you need to know whether an earlier run hit the same problem. For what a turn concluded, prefer memory$history; this is the machinery underneath."
 "log$search"
  "Search the event log for a phrase — a file path, a tool name, an error. Every word of 3+ characters must appear in the same event."}
